      "cooked": "<p>Hey all! Just thought this would be a good place to put small typos or editing errors you find when reading the book, so that the folks at GTG have a community-sourced page they can reference when they reprint the book.</p>\n<p>Try to keep it formatted similarly, so that it’s easy to read/find and help eliminate double-ups. Something like this: Page number, what is wrong, generally where it is, and a quoted example if possible to help locate it.</p>\n<p>Page 137: Missing space in Game Text of Principle of Rage ability. “…Max die.You and each…”</p>\n<p>Page 122: Wrong page number for Principle of Rage reference. Should be 137, not 136.</p>",
